    "description": "Current responsibilities:\n- Lead of CPU core performance modeling team.\n- Working on development of System Z processor core performance model and conducting performance study and analysis for future processor core.\n- Working on design and verification of hardware instrumentation facilities for System Z processor core and conducting performance analysis and projection of current and future processor core.\n- Working on design and verification of hardware instruction trace for System Z processor core and its integration into the performance measurement process by creating traces fed into core performance model. \n\nPast accomplishments:\n- Developed a software emulator for next generation HPC I/O hub architecture.\n- Developed microcode for HPC communication adapter.\n- Developed simulation environment for HPC communication adapter microcode.\n- Developed a performance profiling tool for performanace tuning and analysis of HPC communication adapter microcode.\n- Developed a verification tool for DRAM control logic in MXT memory controller using Verilog.",
